{"id": "65050", "title": "军婚，首长小妻", "author": "黛紫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65050.htm", "intro": "苍天啊，她的未婚夫竟然上了姐姐的那个，如何能忍受？\r\n　　大地啊！空降了一个解放军叔叔，那姑且借来演一场戏气气那个负心男！\r\n　　可是，这妖孽男人竟然是个撒旦，还一口就吃定了她！\r\n　　一句气话：做我的老公吧？还真就被他给办了！真尼玛！\r\n　　还更没想到，这个空降的恶魔老公竟然还是前未婚夫也就是未来姐夫的亲弟弟！\r\n　　这世道，怎么就这么凑巧呢？\r\n　　当假戏遇到真做，当假戏遇到真爱，又会擦出多少火花？\r\n　　片段1：\r\n　　媚儿，怎么样？还疼吗？\r\n　　能不疼吗？那么大？\r\n　　不是我大，是你小！亲，咱们就学习老奶奶铁杵成针的精神，多磨就0K!\r\n　　片段2\r\n　　军医小姐，请给我检查下男人最最关键部位！好像出了问题！\r\n　　好，脱吧！\r\n　　天，小姐！你怎么能用棍子？请用手！\r\n　　-------------------------新人一枚，请多关照！------------------------------", "base": "files/article/html/65/65050", "chapters": [{"title": "1-4", "file": "9686068.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-8", "file": "9686070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-12", "file": "9686071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-15", "file": "9686072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9686073.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "9686074.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "9686075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9686077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "9686079.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "9686081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "9686084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-56", "file": "9686087.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-60", "file": "9686095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "9686097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "9686098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "9686099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-79", "file": "9686101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "80-82", "file": "9686103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "83-86", "file": "9686105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "87-90", "file": "9686108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-93", "file": "9686115.html"